    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n96369" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στεγ-άζω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στέγω</span>
			, <i>cover</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀσπίδες στεγάζουσι τὰ σώματα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>Cyr.</u>
					7.1.33
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ στεγάζον</span>, of the body
				<i>which covers</i> the soul, <i><span class="en">
				Epicur.
				<u>Ep.</u>
				1p.21U.
			</span></i>, cf.<i><span class="en">
				pp.8,20
			</span></i> U. (
				Pass.
			); <i>roof</i> a building, <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				22.1046.16
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(i B.C.)</span>, <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>2 Ch.</u>
				34.11
			</span></i>; [
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περιστάσεις] ς. γείσεσιν λιθίνοις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>OGI</u>
					483.126
				</span></i>
			 (Pergam., 
			<span class="entity">ii A.D.</span>): metaph., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στεγάσαι φρενὸς εἴσω</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Emp.
					3
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὕπνος ς. τινά</span>
			<i>covers, embraces</i>, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>El.</u>
				781
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στεγάζεσθαι τῇ γῇ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Thphr.
					<u>CP</u>
					1.12.3
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Oec.</u>
				19.13
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πλοῖον ἐστεγασμένον</span> a
				<i>decked</i> vessel, <i><span class="en">
				Antipho
				5.22
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἵνα στεγασθῇ</span> (sc.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ χώματα</span>) <i>be rendered
				water-tight</i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PSI</u>
				5.486.10
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii B.C.)</span>; [
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἰκία] ἐστεγασμένη</span>”
				<i>roofed,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					PCair.Zen.
					251.7
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(iii B.C.)</span>.</div>
